# copyframe_binary_diff dictionary (PARSER-INVENTORY lane). Tokens for the COPY
# binary per-field length framing (i32 big-endian length words): the -1 NULL
# sentinel, zero-length, small lengths, and the illegal-negative / oversize
# length words that must be rejected identically. Input layout is
# [selector][stream]; these tokens seed the stream tail.
# -1 NULL sentinel (i32 BE)
"\xff\xff\xff\xff"
# zero-length field
"\x00\x00\x00\x00"
# length 1 / 4
"\x00\x00\x00\x01"
"\x00\x00\x00\x04"
# illegal negative (not -1)
"\xff\xff\xff\xfe"
"\x80\x00\x00\x00"
# oversize length word
"\x7f\xff\xff\xff"
